      "entryId": "jos-24-32",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Joseph's coffin from Exodus 13 is buried in Shechem's purchased field. First principle: a four-hundred-year-old promise made the pilgrimage carry bones — faith in resurrection-land down to the funeral.",
