    {
      "entryId": "jos-24-15",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The choice framed and decided personally: as for me and my house. First principle: neutrality is impossibility — serve the fathers' gods or the LORD; Joshua's household decides first.",
